# Build context for templates/Dockerfile (context: templates/).
#
# A deny-list on purpose. An allow-list (`*` then `!*/template.json`) works in Docker, but buildah (used by Vercel) does
# not look inside folders that `*` excluded, so the systems' template.json files went missing from the build.

# Chipnet test wallets and engine databases: mnemonic, keys, invitations. Never in an image.
.xo-demo
**/.xo-demo
**/*.sqlite
**/mnemonic*.txt
**/minter-key*.txt
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Installed and built output; the image installs and builds its own.
**/node_modules
**/dist
*.log
